  # the fall to the floor (the landing gives everything back again and makes the next cling fresh);
  # the teleport; the air jump, the up-dash, the fresh cling, the up-dash from it and the air jump.
  0..65 R
  66..86 jump
  88..106 jump
  108 U !dash
  129..135 R
  136 U !dash
  159 jump
  160..162 L jump
  163..177 jump
  179 U !toss
  228 !toss
  229..247 jump
  249 U !dash
  270..274 R
  275 U !dash
  298..316 jump
